      "source": "Simple value object to wrap a nullable delegate. Used to be able to write <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> implementations that\nconvert null into an object of some sort.",
      "translation": "一个简单的值对象，用于包装可空委托。它使得能够编写 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert.converter 中的类或接口\"><code>Converter</code></a> 实现，从而将 null 转换为某种对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type of the contained value. Will fall back to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> in case the value is null.",
      "translation": "返回包含值的类型。如果值为 null，则回退到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
